                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill cuts taxes and makes sure illegal immigrants don\u2019t improperly receive Medicaid benefits. Radical Democrats in California want to do the opposite - they want to raise taxes to give free healthcare to illegal immigrants as soon as they cross the border.",
